{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rZXxL9ETcO1794650286.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子在社交平台購買迪士尼樂園門票，之後發現門票無效，警方暫列詐騙案處理。</p><p></p><p>據了解，一名44歲男子9月在社交平台，看到有人以400元出售兩張迪士尼樂園門票。他之後透過「轉數快」轉帳，對方在交易後發送一個二維碼，標示為樂園電子門票。</p><p></p><p>三日後他再聯絡賣家，打算查詢門票升級，但發現對方已刪除所有訊息，到官網查詢時，更發現門票無效，於是報警。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:03:57.561504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:00:08.328146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:13.841294+00:00","content_hash":"30422aa69212b49abb3e435385df8ed989a3795eb1161a07c95b7fdf453baa48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}